        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Bullseye.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Bullseye."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_193_frostl_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   Aren't we making too much noise?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "Aren't we making too much noise?"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_193_frostl_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   There are a ton of explosions all over the city. I don't think they'll notice.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "There are a ton of explosions all over the city. I don't think they'll notice."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Have you notified Dr. Kal'tsit yet?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Have you notified Dr. Kal'tsit yet?"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_193_frostl_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   I called her before the battle started.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "I called her before the battle started."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   There's evidence that Reunion is conducting their operations in this city.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "There's evidence that Reunion is conducting their operations in this city."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   I haven't hung up yet.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "I haven't hung up yet."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   Shouldn't we be a bit stealthier with our movements?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "Shouldn't we be a bit stealthier with our movements?"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_193_frostl_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   That Reunion member just now seemed to be using Detection-type Arts.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "That Reunion member just now seemed to be using Detection-type Arts."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   We'll have to strike first so that we don't give away our location.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "We'll have to strike first so that we don't give away our location."
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   At least, we can't give these Reunion squads time to communicate with each other.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "At least, we can't give these Reunion squads time to communicate with each other."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   Phew... It's finally over...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "Phew... It's finally over..."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Frostleaf, assess the situation.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Frostleaf, assess the situation."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_193_frostl_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   Understood.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   Here, hold on to the comms device.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "Here, hold on to the comms device."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Sure.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Sure."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Jessica, don't let your guard down yet.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Jessica, don't let your guard down yet."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1#3\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   Of course... I'm aware of that!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "Of course... I'm aware of that!"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1#3\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   All right, all right. I won't mention it again.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "All right, all right. I won't mention it again."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Dr. Kal'tsit, can you hear me?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Dr. Kal'tsit, can you hear me?"
    },
